{'symbol': 'XOM', 'date': '2019-12-22 00:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'ExxonMobil Begins Oil Production In Guyana', 'text': 'BEGINS OIL PRODUCTION IN GUYANA.PRODUCTION FOR LIZA PHASE 1 TO REACH FULL CAPACITY OF 120,000 BARRELS OF OIL PER DAY IN COMING MONTHS.MORE THAN 1,700 GUYANESE HAVE WORKED ON EXXONMOBIL ACTIVITIES IN GUYANA.OIL PRODUCTION HAS STARTED FROM LIZA FIELD OFFSHORE GUYANA AHEAD OF SCHEDULE.EXXONMOBIL AND ITS DIRECT CONTRACTORS HAVE SPENT APPROXIMATELY $180 MILLION WITH MORE THAN 630 LOCAL SUPPLIERS SINCE 2015.'}{'symbol': 'HES', 'date': '2019-12-22 00:30:00-04:56', 'title': 'Hess Announces First Production From Liza Field, Offshore Guyana', 'text': 'HESS ANNOUNCES FIRST PRODUCTION FROM LIZA FIELD, OFFSHORE GUYANA.PRODUCTION TO REACH FULL CAPACITY OF 120,000 GROSS BARRELS OF OIL PER DAY IN COMING MONTHS.EXXONMOBIL AFFILIATE ESSO EXPLORATION AND PRODUCTION GUYANA LIMITED IS OPERATOR AND HOLDS 45 PERCENT INTEREST IN STABROEK BLOCK.HESS GUYANA EXPLORATION HAS 30% INTEREST, CNOOC PETROLEUM GUYANA LIMITED, WHOLLY-OWNED SUBSIDIARY OF CNOOC, HAS 25 % INTEREST IN STABROEK BLOCK.'}